{"weakness":{"title":"Calculadora de Fraquezas (Gen 3)","content":"\n            <div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n                <p style=\"color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.9rem; margin-bottom: 15px;\">Selecione os tipos do Pokémon para ver suas fraquezas e resistências. Baseado na Geração 3 (Sem Fada).</p>\n                <div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; justify-content:center; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n                    <select id=\"calc-type-1\" class=\"input-select\" style=\"text-transform:capitalize;\"></select>\n                    <select id=\"calc-type-2\" class=\"input-select\" style=\"text-transform:capitalize;\">\n                        <option value=\"none\">-- Nenhum (Tipo Único) --</option>\n                    </select>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"calc-result\" style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(120px, 1fr)); gap:10px; text-align:left;\">\n                    <!-- Preenchido via JS -->\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        "},"natures":{"title":"Guia de Natures (Naturezas)","content":"\n            <div style=\"overflow-x: auto;\">\n                <table class=\"moves-table\" style=\"width:100%; text-align:center; min-width:500px;\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr><th>Nature</th><th>Aumenta (+10%)</th><th>Diminui (-10%)</th><th>Sabor Favorito (Pokécubo)</th><th>Sabor Detestado</th></tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody id=\"natures-table-body\">\n                        <!-- Injetado via JS -->\n                        <tr><td colspan=\"5\">Carregando...</td></tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n        "},"berries":{"title":"Guia de Berries & Pokéblocks (Como evoluir Feebas)","content":"\n            <div style=\"text-align:left;\">\n                <p>O <strong>Feebas</strong> só evolui para <strong>Milotic</strong> quando seu nível de Beleza (Beauty) atinge o máximo (170) e depois ele sobe de nível. Para isso, você precisa alimentá-lo com Pokéblocks azuis feitos a partir de Berries específicas.</p>\n                \n                <h4 style=\"color:var(--type-water); margin-top:15px;\">Melhores Berries para Beleza:</h4>\n                <ul style=\"color:var(--text-muted); margin-left: 20px;\">\n                    <li><strong>Pamtre Berry</strong> (A melhor do jogo, mas muito rara. Obtida dizendo \"CHALLENGE CONTEST\" para a esposa do Berry Master).</li>\n                    <li><strong>Cornn Berry</strong> (Excelente alternativa, fácil de conseguir).</li>\n                    <li><strong>Kelpsy Berry</strong> (Boa, reduz Attack EVs).</li>\n                    <li><strong>Hondew Berry</strong> (Boa, reduz Sp. Atk EVs).</li>\n                    <li><strong>Chesto Berry</strong> / <strong>Oran Berry</strong> (Opções de baixo nível para o início do jogo, mas exigem bater os Pokéblocks perfeitamente para atingir 170).</li>\n                </ul>\n\n                <h4 style=\"color:var(--type-water); margin-top:15px;\">Dicas de Nature:</h4>\n                <p style=\"color:var(--text-muted);\">As Natures do Pokémon afetam quais sabores eles gostam. Natures que <strong>gostam de sabor Seco (Dry)</strong> terão bônus enormes ao comer Pokéblocks azuis, facilitando muito a evolução:</p>\n                <ul style=\"color:var(--text-muted); margin-left: 20px;\">\n                    <li><strong>Gostam (Recomendado):</strong> Modest, Mild, Rash, Quiet.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Não Gostam (Evite):</strong> Adamant, Impish, Careful, Jolly.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        "},"stones":{"title":"Guia de Itens de Evolução","content":"\n            <div style=\"overflow-x: auto;\">\n                <table class=\"moves-table\" style=\"width:100%; text-align:left; min-width:600px;\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr><th>Item</th><th>Evoluções Chaves</th><th>Onde Encontrar (Hoenn)</th><th>Onde Encontrar (Kanto)</th></tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\"><img src=\"./img/items/fire-stone.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\" loading=\"lazy\">Fire Stone</strong></td><td>Vulpix, Growlithe, Eevee</td><td>Fiery Path</td><td>Celadon Dept. Store, Mt. Ember</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\"><img src=\"./img/items/water-stone.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\" loading=\"lazy\">Water Stone</strong></td><td>Poliwhirl, Shellder, Staryu, Eevee, Lombre</td><td>Abandoned Ship</td><td>Celadon Dept. Store, Seafoam Islands</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\"><img src=\"./img/items/thunder-stone.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\" loading=\"lazy\">Thunder Stone</strong></td><td>Pikachu, Eevee</td><td>New Mauville</td><td>Celadon Dept. Store, Power Plant</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\"><img src=\"./img/items/leaf-stone.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\" loading=\"lazy\">Leaf Stone</strong></td><td>Gloom, Weepinbell, Exeggcute, Nuzleaf</td><td>Route 119</td><td>Celadon Dept. Store, Safari Zone</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\"><img src=\"./img/items/moon-stone.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\" loading=\"lazy\">Moon Stone</strong></td><td>Nidorina, Nidorino, Clefairy, Jigglypuff, Skitty</td><td>Meteor Falls</td><td>Mt. Moon, Celadon City</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\"><img src=\"./img/items/sun-stone.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\" loading=\"lazy\">Sun Stone</strong></td><td>Gloom, Sunkern</td><td>Mossdeep City</td><td>Ruin Valley, Segurado por Solrock selvagem</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\"><img src=\"./img/items/dragon-scale.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\" loading=\"lazy\">Dragon Scale</strong></td><td>Seadra -> Kingdra</td><td>Segurado por Horsea/Bagon selvagens</td><td>Water Path</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;\"><img src=\"./img/items/metal-coat.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\" loading=\"lazy\">Metal Coat</strong></td><td>Onix -> Steelix, Scyther -> Scizor</td><td>Segurado por Magnemite selvagens</td><td>Memorial Pillar</td></tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n        "},"safari":{"title":"Guia da Safari Zone","content":"\n            <div style=\"text-align:left; color:var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem;\">\n                <p>A Safari Zone é uma área especial onde você captura Pokémon utilizando <strong>Safari Balls</strong> em vez de batalhar. Abaixo você encontra os Pokémon exclusivos e os itens de cada zona.</p>\n                \n                <h3 style=\"color:var(--type-grass); margin-top: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border); padding-bottom: 5px;\">Hoenn (Emerald / Ruby & Sapphire)</h3>\n                <div style=\"overflow-x: auto; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                    <table class=\"moves-table\" style=\"width:100%; text-align:left; min-width:600px;\">\n                        <thead>\n                            <tr><th>Zona / Requisito</th><th>Encontros Notáveis / Exclusivos</th><th>Itens no Chão</th></tr>\n                        </thead>\n                        <tbody>\n                            <tr><td><strong>Área 1 & 2 (Sul)</strong><br><small>Entrada principal</small></td><td>Oddish, Gloom, Doduo, Pikachu, Wobbuffet, Natu, Girafarig.</td><td>Max Potion</td></tr>\n                            <tr><td><strong>Área 3 (Norte)</strong><br><small>Requer Acro Bike</small></td><td>Heracross, Phanpy, Xatu, Pinsir.</td><td>Calcium, TM22 (SolarBeam)</td></tr>\n                            <tr><td><strong>Área 4 (Nordeste)</strong><br><small>Requer Mach Bike</small></td><td>Rhyhorn, Pinsir, Dodrio.</td><td>Zinc</td></tr>\n                            <tr><td><strong>Expansão (Leste/Sudeste)</strong><br><small>Pós-Jogo (Apenas Emerald)</small></td><td><strong>Exclusivos de Johto:</strong> Mareep, Houndour, Aipom, Pineco, Shuckle, Gligar, Snubbull, Teddiursa, Smeargle, Miltank.</td><td>Big Pearl, Rare Candy, Nugget</td></tr>\n                        </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                </div>\n\n                <h3 style=\"color:var(--type-grass); margin-top: 35px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border); padding-bottom: 5px;\">Kanto (FireRed / LeafGreen)</h3>\n                <div style=\"overflow-x: auto; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                    <table class=\"moves-table\" style=\"width:100%; text-align:left; min-width:600px;\">\n                        <thead>\n                            <tr><th>Zona / Área</th><th>Encontros Notáveis / Exclusivos</th><th>Itens no Chão</th></tr>\n                        </thead>\n                        <tbody>\n                            <tr><td><strong>Center Area</strong><br><small>Entrada</small></td><td>Scyther (FR), Pinsir (LG), Chansey, Exeggcute, Rhyhorn, Dratini (Super Rod).</td><td>Nugget</td></tr>\n                            <tr><td><strong>Area 1 (Leste)</strong></td><td>Kangaskhan, Scyther (FR), Pinsir (LG), Doduo, Dragonair.</td><td>Leaf Stone, TM11 (Sunny Day), Max Potion, Full Restore</td></tr>\n                            <tr><td><strong>Area 2 (Norte)</strong></td><td>Tauros, Kangaskhan, Chansey, Venomoth.</td><td>Quick Claw, TM47 (Steel Wing), Protein, Calcium</td></tr>\n                            <tr><td><strong>Area 3 (Oeste)</strong><br><small>Casa Secreta</small></td><td>Tauros, Kangaskhan, Venomoth, Doduo.</td><td>Gold Teeth, HM03 (Surf), Max Revive, Max Potion, Revive</td></tr>\n                        </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div style=\"background:var(--glass-bg); border:1px solid var(--glass-border); padding:15px; border-radius:12px; margin-top:25px;\">\n                    <h4 style=\"color:var(--primary-color); margin-bottom:5px;\">💡 Dica de Captura</h4>\n                    <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem; margin:0;\">Jogar <strong>Pokéblocks/Bait</strong> (Isca) deixa o Pokémon menos propenso a fugir, mas mais difícil de capturar. Jogar <strong>Lama/Pedra</strong> torna o Pokémon mais fácil de capturar, mas mais propenso a fugir.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        <div class=\"guia-galeria\"><strong>Pokémon citados neste guia</strong><div class=\"guia-galeria-tira\"><a href=\"#pokemon/25\" title=\"Pikachu\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/25.png\" alt=\"Pikachu\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/43\" title=\"Oddish\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/43.png\" alt=\"Oddish\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/44\" title=\"Gloom\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/44.png\" alt=\"Gloom\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/49\" title=\"Venomoth\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/49.png\" alt=\"Venomoth\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/84\" title=\"Doduo\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/84.png\" alt=\"Doduo\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/85\" title=\"Dodrio\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/85.png\" alt=\"Dodrio\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/102\" title=\"Exeggcute\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/102.png\" alt=\"Exeggcute\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/111\" title=\"Rhyhorn\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/111.png\" alt=\"Rhyhorn\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/113\" title=\"Chansey\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/113.png\" alt=\"Chansey\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/115\" title=\"Kangaskhan\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/115.png\" alt=\"Kangaskhan\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/123\" title=\"Scyther\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/123.png\" alt=\"Scyther\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/127\" title=\"Pinsir\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/127.png\" alt=\"Pinsir\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/128\" title=\"Tauros\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/128.png\" alt=\"Tauros\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/147\" title=\"Dratini\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/147.png\" alt=\"Dratini\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/148\" title=\"Dragonair\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/148.png\" alt=\"Dragonair\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/177\" title=\"Natu\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/177.png\" alt=\"Natu\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/178\" title=\"Xatu\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/178.png\" alt=\"Xatu\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/179\" title=\"Mareep\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/179.png\" alt=\"Mareep\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/190\" title=\"Aipom\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/190.png\" alt=\"Aipom\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/202\" title=\"Wobbuffet\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/202.png\" alt=\"Wobbuffet\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/203\" title=\"Girafarig\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/203.png\" alt=\"Girafarig\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/204\" title=\"Pineco\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/204.png\" alt=\"Pineco\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/207\" title=\"Gligar\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/207.png\" alt=\"Gligar\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/209\" title=\"Snubbull\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/209.png\" alt=\"Snubbull\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/213\" title=\"Shuckle\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/213.png\" alt=\"Shuckle\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/214\" title=\"Heracross\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/214.png\" alt=\"Heracross\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/216\" title=\"Teddiursa\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/216.png\" alt=\"Teddiursa\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/228\" title=\"Houndour\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/228.png\" alt=\"Houndour\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/231\" title=\"Phanpy\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/231.png\" alt=\"Phanpy\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/235\" title=\"Smeargle\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/235.png\" alt=\"Smeargle\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/241\" title=\"Miltank\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/241.png\" alt=\"Miltank\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a></div></div>"},"sevii":{"title":"Guia das Sevii Islands (FRLG)","content":"\n            <div style=\"text-align:left; color:var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem;\">\n                <p>As Sevii Islands são um arquipélago exclusivo de Pokémon FireRed e LeafGreen. As ilhas 1-3 são acessadas após vencer o Ginásio de Cinnabar, enquanto as ilhas 4-7 exigem vencer a Elite 4 e possuir o National Pokédex.</p>\n                <div style=\"text-align:center; margin: 20px 0;\">\n                    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/items/rainbow-pass.png\" alt=\"Rainbow Pass\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated; width:60px; filter:drop-shadow(2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5));\">\n                </div>\n                \n                <h3 style=\"color:var(--type-fire); margin-top: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border); padding-bottom: 5px;\">Knot Island (Ilha 1)</h3>\n                <p>O lar da Pokémon Network Center e do Mt. Ember. Lar de Moltres.</p>\n                <ul style=\"margin-left:20px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\n                    <li><strong>Pokémon Notáveis:</strong> Ponyta, Rapidash, Magmar (LG), Machop, Geodude, Moltres.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Itens Importantes:</strong> Ruby (Network Center), Fire Stone.</li>\n                </ul>\n\n                <h3 style=\"color:var(--type-water); margin-top: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border); padding-bottom: 5px;\">Boon Island (Ilha 2)</h3>\n                <p>O lar do Move Maniac e do Game Corner. Não possui áreas de mato alto selvagem, mas é crucial para utilidades.</p>\n                <ul style=\"margin-left:20px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\n                    <li><strong>Pokémon Notáveis:</strong> Dunsparce (Water Path).</li>\n                    <li><strong>Itens Importantes:</strong> Meteorite (Troca), Moon Stone.</li>\n                </ul>\n\n                <h3 style=\"color:var(--type-grass); margin-top: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border); padding-bottom: 5px;\">Kin Island (Ilha 3)</h3>\n                <p>Invadida temporariamente por motoqueiros e lar da assustadora Berry Forest.</p>\n                <ul style=\"margin-left:20px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\n                    <li><strong>Pokémon Notáveis:</strong> Drowzee, Hypno, Exeggcute, Venonat, Grimer.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Itens Importantes:</strong> Full Restore, Max Ether.</li>\n                </ul>\n\n                <h3 style=\"color:var(--type-ice); margin-top: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border); padding-bottom: 5px;\">Floe Island (Ilha 4)</h3>\n                <p>Uma ilha congelada onde vive Lorelei, da Elite Four. Lar da Icefall Cave.</p>\n                <ul style=\"margin-left:20px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\n                    <li><strong>Pokémon Notáveis:</strong> Swinub, Piloswine, Sneasel (LG), Delibird (FR), Lapras, Seel, Dewgong.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Itens Importantes:</strong> HM07 (Waterfall), NeverMeltIce.</li>\n                </ul>\n\n                <h3 style=\"color:var(--type-electric); margin-top: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border); padding-bottom: 5px;\">Chrono Island (Ilha 5)</h3>\n                <p>Uma ilha de ruínas (Resort Gorgeous e Lost Cave). Lar do esconderijo final da Equipe Rocket.</p>\n                <ul style=\"margin-left:20px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\n                    <li><strong>Pokémon Notáveis:</strong> Togepi (Water Labyrinth Egg), Murkrow (FR), Misdreavus (LG), Sentret, Hoppip.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Itens Importantes:</strong> Sapphire (Rocket Warehouse), Up-Grade, Metal Coat.</li>\n                </ul>\n\n                <h3 style=\"color:var(--type-bug); margin-top: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border); padding-bottom: 5px;\">Fortune Island (Ilha 6)</h3>\n                <p>Lar da Altering Cave e do Ruin Valley. Uma ilha repleta de mistérios.</p>\n                <ul style=\"margin-left:20px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\n                    <li><strong>Pokémon Notáveis:</strong> Yanma, Natu, Wobbuffet, Heracross, Ledyba, Spinarak.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Itens Importantes:</strong> Sun Stone, Dragon Scale.</li>\n                </ul>\n\n                <h3 style=\"color:var(--type-psychic); margin-top: 25px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border); padding-bottom: 5px;\">Quest Island (Ilha 7)</h3>\n                <p>A ilha final, lar do Trainer Tower e das misteriosas Sevault Canyons e Tanoby Ruins (Unown).</p>\n                <ul style=\"margin-left:20px; margin-bottom:15px;\">\n                    <li><strong>Pokémon Notáveis:</strong> Unown (28 formas), Larvitar, Skarmory (FR), Mantine (LG), Phanpy, Onix.</li>\n                    <li><strong>Itens Importantes:</strong> King's Rock, Metal Coat, Up-Grade (Trainer Tower), Lucky Punch.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        <div class=\"guia-galeria\"><strong>Pokémon citados neste guia</strong><div class=\"guia-galeria-tira\"><a href=\"#pokemon/48\" title=\"Venonat\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/48.png\" alt=\"Venonat\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/66\" title=\"Machop\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/66.png\" alt=\"Machop\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/74\" title=\"Geodude\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/74.png\" alt=\"Geodude\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/77\" title=\"Ponyta\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/77.png\" alt=\"Ponyta\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/78\" title=\"Rapidash\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/78.png\" alt=\"Rapidash\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/86\" title=\"Seel\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/86.png\" alt=\"Seel\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/87\" title=\"Dewgong\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/87.png\" alt=\"Dewgong\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/88\" title=\"Grimer\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/88.png\" alt=\"Grimer\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/95\" title=\"Onix\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/95.png\" alt=\"Onix\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/96\" title=\"Drowzee\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/96.png\" alt=\"Drowzee\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/97\" title=\"Hypno\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/97.png\" alt=\"Hypno\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/102\" title=\"Exeggcute\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/102.png\" alt=\"Exeggcute\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/126\" title=\"Magmar\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/126.png\" alt=\"Magmar\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/131\" title=\"Lapras\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/131.png\" alt=\"Lapras\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/146\" title=\"Moltres\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/146.png\" alt=\"Moltres\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/161\" title=\"Sentret\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/161.png\" alt=\"Sentret\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/165\" title=\"Ledyba\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/165.png\" alt=\"Ledyba\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/167\" title=\"Spinarak\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/167.png\" alt=\"Spinarak\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/175\" title=\"Togepi\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/175.png\" alt=\"Togepi\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/177\" title=\"Natu\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/177.png\" alt=\"Natu\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/187\" title=\"Hoppip\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/187.png\" alt=\"Hoppip\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/193\" title=\"Yanma\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/193.png\" alt=\"Yanma\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/198\" title=\"Murkrow\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/198.png\" alt=\"Murkrow\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/200\" title=\"Misdreavus\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/200.png\" alt=\"Misdreavus\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/201\" title=\"Unown\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/201.png\" alt=\"Unown\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/202\" title=\"Wobbuffet\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/202.png\" alt=\"Wobbuffet\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/206\" title=\"Dunsparce\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/206.png\" alt=\"Dunsparce\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/214\" title=\"Heracross\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/214.png\" alt=\"Heracross\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/215\" title=\"Sneasel\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/215.png\" alt=\"Sneasel\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/220\" title=\"Swinub\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/220.png\" alt=\"Swinub\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/221\" title=\"Piloswine\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/221.png\" alt=\"Piloswine\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/225\" title=\"Delibird\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/225.png\" alt=\"Delibird\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/226\" title=\"Mantine\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/226.png\" alt=\"Mantine\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/227\" title=\"Skarmory\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/227.png\" alt=\"Skarmory\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/231\" title=\"Phanpy\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/231.png\" alt=\"Phanpy\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a><a href=\"#pokemon/246\" title=\"Larvitar\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"./img/pokemon/full/246.png\" alt=\"Larvitar\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"image-rendering:pixelated;\"></a></div></div>"},"ev":{"title":"Melhores Locais para Treinar EVs (Gen 3)","content":"\n            <div style=\"text-align:left;\">\n                <p style=\"color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.9rem;\">Para treinar Effort Values de forma eficiente, derrote repetidamente os Pokémon listados abaixo segurando o <strong>Macho Brace</strong> (dobra os EVs ganhos em batalha).</p>\n                \n                <h3 style=\"color:var(--type-fire); margin-top:20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\">Em Hoenn (Ruby / Sapphire / Emerald)</h3>\n                <table class=\"moves-table\" style=\"width:100%; text-align:left; font-size:0.9rem;\">\n                    <thead><tr><th>Atributo</th><th>Local</th><th>Pokémon Alvo (EVs ganhos)</th></tr></thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"color:var(--type-grass);\">HP</strong></td><td>Route 114 (Surf) / Rusturf Tunnel</td><td>Marill (2), Whismur (1)</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"color:var(--type-fighting);\">Attack</strong></td><td>Mt. Pyre (1º andar)</td><td>Shuppet (1)</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"color:var(--type-rock);\">Defense</strong></td><td>Magma Hideout / Route 111 (Deserto)</td><td>Torkoal (2), Geodude (1), Sandshrew (1)</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"color:var(--type-psychic);\">Sp. Atk</strong></td><td>Route 113 (Cinzas)</td><td>Spinda (1), Slugma (1)</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"color:var(--type-bug);\">Sp. Def</strong></td><td>Abandoned Ship (Surf)</td><td>Tentacool (1)</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"color:var(--type-electric);\">Speed</strong></td><td>Route 104 / Altering Cave</td><td>Zigzagoon (1), Taillow (1), Zubat (1)</td></tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n\n                <h3 style=\"color:var(--type-fire); margin-top:20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);\">Em Kanto (FireRed / LeafGreen)</h3>\n                <table class=\"moves-table\" style=\"width:100%; text-align:left; font-size:0.9rem;\">\n                    <thead><tr><th>Atributo</th><th>Local</th><th>Pokémon Alvo (EVs ganhos)</th></tr></thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"color:var(--type-grass);\">HP</strong></td><td>Three Island (Port / Cape Brink - Surf)</td><td>Slowpoke (1), Dunsparce (1)</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"color:var(--type-fighting);\">Attack</strong></td><td>Mt. Moon (B1F) / Route 1</td><td>Paras (1), Mankey (1)</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"color:var(--type-rock);\">Defense</strong></td><td>Route 21 (Mato) / Mt. Moon</td><td>Tangela (1), Geodude (1)</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"color:var(--type-psychic);\">Sp. Atk</strong></td><td>Pokémon Tower (Andares altos)</td><td>Gastly (1), Haunter (2)</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"color:var(--type-bug);\">Sp. Def</strong></td><td>Kindle Road (Surf)</td><td>Tentacool (1), Tentacruel (2)</td></tr>\n                        <tr><td><strong style=\"color:var(--type-electric);\">Speed</strong></td><td>Diglett's Cave</td><td>Diglett (1), Dugtrio (2)</td></tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n        "},"frontier":{"title":"O Mega Guia do Battle Frontier (Emerald)","content":"\n            <div style=\"text-align:left;\">\n                <p style=\"color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.9rem;\">O Battle Frontier é o desafio supremo de Pokémon Emerald. Reúne 7 instalações de batalha, cada uma com regras únicas. Vença rodadas suficientes para enfrentar o Frontier Brain (Líder).</p>\n                \n                <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 15px; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                    <div style=\"background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3); padding:15px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid var(--glass-border);\">\n                        <h4 style=\"margin:0 0 5px 0; color:var(--type-normal);\">Battle Tower</h4>\n                        <p style=\"font-size:0.8rem; margin:0; color:var(--text-muted);\">Batalhas tradicionais sem regalias. Teste de habilidade pura.</p>\n                        <small style=\"color:var(--primary-color);\">Brain: Salon Maiden Anabel (Rodada 35 e 70)</small>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <div style=\"background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3); padding:15px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid var(--glass-border);\">\n                        <h4 style=\"margin:0 0 5px 0; color:var(--type-water);\">Battle Factory</h4>\n                        <p style=\"font-size:0.8rem; margin:0; color:var(--text-muted);\">Lute usando Pokémon alugados! Troque de Pokémon com os perdedores.</p>\n                        <small style=\"color:var(--primary-color);\">Brain: Factory Head Noland (Rodada 21 e 42)</small>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div style=\"background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3); padding:15px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid var(--glass-border);\">\n                        <h4 style=\"margin:0 0 5px 0; color:var(--type-fighting);\">Battle Arena</h4>\n                        <p style=\"font-size:0.8rem; margin:0; color:var(--text-muted);\">Batalhas de 3 turnos. Se não nocautear, juízes decidem por Mind, Skill e Body.</p>\n                        <small style=\"color:var(--primary-color);\">Brain: Arena Tycoon Greta (Rodada 28 e 56)</small>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div style=\"background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3); padding:15px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid var(--glass-border);\">\n                        <h4 style=\"margin:0 0 5px 0; color:var(--type-fire);\">Battle Dome</h4>\n                        <p style=\"font-size:0.8rem; margin:0; color:var(--text-muted);\">Torneio estilo chaveamento de 16 treinadores. Mostra o time inimigo antes!</p>\n                        <small style=\"color:var(--primary-color);\">Brain: Dome Ace Tucker (Torneio 5 e 10)</small>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div style=\"background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3); padding:15px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid var(--glass-border);\">\n                        <h4 style=\"margin:0 0 5px 0; color:var(--type-poison);\">Battle Pike</h4>\n                        <p style=\"font-size:0.8rem; margin:0; color:var(--text-muted);\">Escolha entre 3 portas: cure seu time, enfrente status negativo ou lute contra treinadores.</p>\n                        <small style=\"color:var(--primary-color);\">Brain: Pike Queen Lucy (Sala 28 e 140)</small>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div style=\"background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3); padding:15px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid var(--glass-border);\">\n                        <h4 style=\"margin:0 0 5px 0; color:var(--type-grass);\">Battle Palace</h4>\n                        <p style=\"font-size:0.8rem; margin:0; color:var(--text-muted);\">Os Pokémon atacam sozinhos baseados na sua Nature!</p>\n                        <small style=\"color:var(--primary-color);\">Brain: Palace Maven Spenser (Rodada 21 e 42)</small>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div style=\"background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3); padding:15px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid var(--glass-border);\">\n                        <h4 style=\"margin:0 0 5px 0; color:var(--type-rock);\">Battle Pyramid</h4>\n                        <p style=\"font-size:0.8rem; margin:0; color:var(--text-muted);\">Navegue na escuridão sem seus itens regulares, recolhendo itens do chão pelo labirinto.</p>\n                        <small style=\"color:var(--primary-color);\">Brain: Pyramid King Brandon (Andar 21 e 70)</small>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        "},"bases":{"title":"Guia de Bases Secretas (Hoenn)","content":"\n            <div style=\"text-align:left;\">\n                <p style=\"color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.9rem;\">As Secret Bases são uma das mecânicas mais amadas de RSE. Use <strong>Secret Power</strong> em árvores grandes, buracos na parede ou moitas para cavar sua base. Abaixo as mais populares:</p>\n                \n                <h4 style=\"color:var(--type-ground); margin-top:15px;\">Route 119 (As bases perfeitas)</h4>\n                <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem; margin:0;\">Essa rota tem 6 moitas perto da cachoeira que só podem ser acessadas com Acro Bike + Surf. O formato interno da maioria delas é de um quadrado duplo limpo, perfeito para decorar sem buracos.</p>\n\n                <h4 style=\"color:var(--type-ground); margin-top:15px;\">Route 111 (Deserto)</h4>\n                <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem; margin:0;\">Na subida antes de chegar perto de Fiery Path, existe uma árvore enorme solitária (Tree Base). Uma das bases mais compridas do jogo (estilo corredor com sala no fundo).</p>\n\n                <h4 style=\"color:var(--type-ground); margin-top:15px;\">Route 120 e 121</h4>\n                <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem; margin:0;\">Muitas bases em buracos de cavernas. Cuidado: várias possuem buracos grandes no meio da base, obrigando você a comprar <em>Solid Boards</em> (Tábuas) no mercado de Lilycove (apenas nos dias de Liquidação) para transitar entre os cômodos!</p>\n                \n                <div style=\"background:rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #f39c12; padding:10px; margin-top:20px; font-size:0.85rem;\">\n                    <strong>Dica:</strong> Se você misturar os registros da sua fita (Record Mixing), os locais das bases dos seus amigos aparecerão no seu mundo, permitindo que você batalhe contra o time que eles tinham no momento da mistura diariamente!\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        "}}